{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My sister is fading. The house is cold. And outside\u2026 things are getting worse.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1934. The world is fragile. People are quiet, hungry, scared. But still, every day, someone knocks on the door. And someone must choose who to let in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a man caring for his sick sister in a decaying home. Each day brings a visitor \u2014 a beggar, a liar, a prophet, a stranger. Your answers shape their fate, and yours. Help costs resources. Refusal may cost your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision is recorded in a diary. And the diary remembers more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Every choice changes the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Atmospheric story-driven game set in 1934<br>\u2013 Simple but weighty choices with lasting impact<br>\u2013 Morality, supplies, and conscience define your survival<br>\u2013 Stylized 2D visuals, minimal controls<br>\u2013 Slow-paced, emotionally heavy experience with branching dialogue</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flower guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887290/466cf9f50047d2b3cb172013bf572c5a0fdfeb18.jpg"},{"name":"Finish at the lowest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887290/370d38351f92198556e2a7114673a0c84ec87c9c.jpg"},{"name":"Run away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887290/11dbca0cbeef8e4b2ef7b5e3ecbc4b306722caaf.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887290/628906e2c433225b92dde531a0a448f6382b8d42.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887290?t=1763404236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st